# Integrate Data Enrichment Agent into Step 3

This plan describes how we will integrate the newly tested data enrichment logic (Jina fetch + GPT-4o extraction + Apollo search + Hunter verification) natively into the Step 3: Deep Dive pipeline.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> - Integrating Jina + GPT-4o + Apollo + Hunter directly into the `deep-dive` Edge Function will increase the processing time of a single deep dive by 30-90 seconds. 
> - I will modify `deep-dive` to run the contact enrichment steps in parallel with the main `DEEP_DIVE_PROMPT` (using Promise.all) to save time, and then combine the results before saving to the DB.
> - I will add `enriched_contacts` JSONB column to the `opportunity_packs` table to store this detailed array.

## Proposed Changes

### Database Migration
#### [NEW] `supabase/migrations/20260313_add_enriched_contacts.sql`
- Add `enriched_contacts JSONB DEFAULT '[]'::jsonb` to `opportunity_packs` to store the array of [EnrichedContact](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#9-25) objects.

### Backend Extraction & Storage
