- Copy the helper functions from [enrich-contacts-test/index.ts](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts) ([fetchArticleContent](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#26-41), [callOpenAI](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#42-68), [parseJSON](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#69-82), [apolloSearchExecutives](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#152-186), [apolloFindCompanyDomain](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#187-208), [verifyEmailWithHunter](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#209-222), [EXTRACTION_PROMPT](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#83-151)).
- Update the main request handler:
  1. Fetch article from Jina (instead of the basic GET fetch).
  2. Run the main `DEEP_DIVE_PROMPT` to get the opportunity pack using the Jina content as context.
  3. In parallel (or sequentially if needed), run the [EXTRACTION_PROMPT](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#83-151) via [callOpenAI](file:///Users/ravikantagrawal/Documents/All%20things%20Flytbase/Growth-hacking-tool/mkt-intel-leadgen/bd-pulse-leadgen/supabase/functions/enrich-contacts-test/index.ts#42-68).
  4. Run the Apollo and Hunter steps on the extracted contacts.
  5. Combine the data and save `enriched_contacts` into the `opportunity_packs` insert/update map.
- Remove `phones_mentioned` from the database payload if superseded, or keep it as is and just write `enriched_contacts`.

#### [NEW/MODIFY] `supabase/functions/verify-email/index.ts`
- We will need a dedicated endpoint (or add functionality to an existing one) that takes an `email` string and calls the Hunter API to verify it. This is required because Edge Functions abstract the Hunter API Key away from the React frontend.
- When an email is edited, the frontend will call this function to instantly re-validate the email and update the badge.

